{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "winograd d4: 4 products as 2 pair products and two corrections, under gt1030\n  per output: (a0 + b1)*(a1 + b0) + (a2 + b3)*(a3 + b2) - (xi + eta)\n  xi = a0*a1 + a2*a3 (a row's), eta = b0*b1 + b2*b3 (a column's)\n  identity: (x_2j + y_2j+1)(x_2j+1 + y_2j) = x_2j x_2j+1 + x_2j y_2j + x_2j+1 y_2j+1 + y_2j y_2j+1, so the pairs less xi and eta leave sum x_k y_k: both sides expanded as polynomials agree modulo 2^W (exact, any operands)\n  per output 12 against 12 as written; xi 6, eta 6\n  a 1 x 1 block: 24 against 12 as written: not cheaper\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "winograd", "ucas": "winograd d4", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "winograd", "proved": true, "proof": "algebra", "cost_output": 12, "cost_output_before": 12, "cost_block": 24, "cost_block_before": 12, "cheaper": false, "output": "(a0 + b1)*(a1 + b0) + (a2 + b3)*(a3 + b2) - (xi + eta)", "xi": "a0*a1 + a2*a3", "eta": "b0*b1 + b2*b3"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "winograd d4: 4 products as 2 pair products and two corrections, under gt1030\n  per output: (a0 + b1)*(a1 + b0) + (a2 + b3)*(a3 + b2) - (xi + eta)\n  xi = a0*a1 + a2*a3 (a row's), eta = b0*b1 + b2*b3 (a column's)\n  identity: (x_2j + y_2j+1)(x_2j+1 + y_2j) = x_2j x_2j+1 + x_2j y_2j + x_2j+1 y_2j+1 + y_2j y_2j+1, so the pairs less xi and eta leave sum x_k y_k: both sides expanded as polynomials agree modulo 2^W (exact, any operands)\n  per output 12 against 12 as written; xi 6, eta 6\n  a 1 x 1 block: 24 against 12 as written: not cheaper\n"}, "isError": false}}
